cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BlastingPy in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "BlastingPy: blast vibration, airblast, flyrock and near-field analysis for mining"
abstract: >-
  Open-source blasting effects library for mining: event records and per-country damage criteria, site attenuation
  laws, waveform analysis and signature-hole superposition, airblast, flyrock range and clearance, and near-field
  vibration (Holmberg-Persson and Heelan models). C++20 core with a Python API. Every result records the method and
  the source it follows.
authors:
